  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_297680_(Neo-)Forge.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_585782_Fabric.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadditional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/additional-structures?logo=modrinth&amp;label=&amp;suffix= &amp;style=flat&amp;color=242629&amp;labelColor=5ca424&amp;logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/297680(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Supported Versions\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&amp;logo=discord&amp;style=flat&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"500\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>📖 模组介绍</h2><p>本模组为游戏添加了约250个新的中小型结构，以扩展你的世界！</p><ul>\n<li>支持生物群系生成模组，如Terralith、Traverse、Biomes O' Plenty、Biome Bundle等！</li>\n<li>Mystcraft兼容（MC 1.12）</li>\n<li>提供配置选项，可更改每种结构类型的生成值！（MC 1.12）</li>\n<li>兼容 /locate 指令</li>\n<li>内置更新检查器</li>\n<li>不同的结构在主世界和末地的原版及模组生物群系中生成！</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/config-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置数据包</a></li>\n</ul><p>想在1.18+版本中修改或调整某些结构参数？<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/config-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里查看操作方法！</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处可查看当前版本的所有结构</a>！</p><p>你使用Fabric或Quilt吗？那么请使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此版本</a>！</p><p><br><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>📷 展示图</h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HJ3k534.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BcQcqeI.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mYWKb79.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U20qUIY.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kqG38d8.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wDwNNl4.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZuLeZyF.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Eevyyo9.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aIJVHLA.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7KLxZrl.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8YVKUi0.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bbZ7yxe.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sGMDPw4.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ta7WuIM.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🗃️ 依赖项</h2><h3>必需：</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Magma Core</strong> [≥ MC 1.21.5]\n<ul>\n<li>提供基础代码和功能，如更新检查器</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmagma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h3>支持：</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Mystcraft</strong> [MC 1.12]\n<ul>\n<li>添加了AS结构的特征符号</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmystcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Antique Atlas</strong> [≥ MC 1.21]\n<ul>\n<li>为部分结构在地图上添加标记</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/antique-atlas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fantique-atlas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🎮 我的其他模组！</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Additional Structures\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bedrock Miner\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Tool Upgrades\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"All The Compatibility\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://